<title>UK: Quebec sets 10 billon peseta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Quebec sets 10 billon peseta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Centrale Hispano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF QUEBEC</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    06.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.84    PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.65	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A+     GOV LAW    SPANISH   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.65	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
